+- Bots that can post from scripts and CI jobs
+
+## Posting as a bot
+
+Open **Account Settings**, select **Set up chat bots**, and create a bot. Keep its bot code private, then post to any room the bot belongs to with the raw message as the request body:
+
+```sh
+curl --data "Deploy of v1.2.3 finished" \
+  https://chat.example.com/rooms/ROOM_ID/BOT_CODE/messages
+```
+
+Successful requests return `201 Created` and a `Location` header pointing to the created message. Missing content returns `422 Unprocessable Content`, unknown rooms return `404 Not Found`, and invalid bot codes return `401 Unauthorized`.
 
